  "sourceChanges": [],
  "selection": "Selected project C/header/Makefile, required original BMP assets and root license/README. Omitted editor XCF artwork, scripts, labs, preserved full Minix machine image, OS/VCS/build metadata.",
  "controlsRationale": "Original WASD held states turn the snake; mouse movement sets the aim point and left button selects menus/fires. Panel keeps controls outside the board; no unverified Enter binding. Relative screen input and separate right mouse stick preserve original unit deltas. Initial cursor is640,512; menu Singleplayer occupies100..410,100..190.",
  "artwork": {
    "icon": "Simple bent mint snake with its unmodified original head cropped from real browser gameplay and a green projectile motif. Original assets unchanged.",
    "preview": "Real browser gameplay canvas with original indexed palette, snake and fired projectile."
  },
  "validation": {
    "browser": "Actual landscape844x390 and portrait390x844 CDP touch: relative mouse selects Singleplayer, WASD turns east then south and held Fire emits green projectiles; errors[].",
    "ndk": "All25 authored root C translation units compile under NDK27 ARM64 target26 without source edits.",
    "native": "Root reviewed actual ARM64 APK fa84d3d0afcf0a81b62f582f3838aca04a57f9cf52bd7af099bc38fda9c97f91: mint snake turns east and south, held Fire emits green projectiles and spends body segments, original indexed palette renders correctly; Home cleans up isolated game process. Evidence: build/arcade-100/skane-permissions-native-gameplay/results.json."
  },
  "platformConfiguration": {
    "pathAliases": {
      "/tmp": "."
    },
    "reason": "Original err_utils.c clrlogs writes /tmp/skane_logs.txt. Android /tmp is searchable but not writable by the app UID (measured mode0771, owner2000, fopen w+ errno13). Explicitly map this per-game temporary directory into its private project root using compatibility path configuration. Existing successful real operations retain normal precedence. Original source and assets unchanged.",
    "verification": "Actual original ARM64 game aborts fclose(NULL). Bionic app-UID probe confirms EACCES for original w+ path and successful private write. Owning original clrlogs/warn plus shared resolver regression is RED on baseline errno13, GREEN after explicit-alias permission fallback: create/append/read/truncate/remove private log. Browser gameplay with authored alias passes; full APK retry pending. Full original-game APK now passes native gameplay with the authored alias and shared resolver fix."
  }
